{ "Sharpness", "锐度" },
{ "Override", "覆盖" },
{ "Ignores the value sent by the game\nand uses the value set below", "忽略游戏传入的值\n并使用下方设置的值" },
{ "Enable RCAS/DA", "启用 RCAS/DA" },
{ "Enable OptiScaler's sharpening filter\nBy default uses a sharpening value provided by the game\nSelect 'Override' under 'Sharpness' and adjust the slider\nto change it\n\nSome upscalers have their own sharpness filter, so this\noption is not always needed", "启用 OptiScaler 的锐化滤镜\n默认使用游戏提供的锐度值\n在“锐度”下勾选“覆盖”并调整滑块\n即可更改该值\n\n部分超分器自带锐化滤镜，因此并非总是\n需要此选项" },
{ "Use AMD's RCAS\nModified to add Contrast parameter\nand MAS support", "使用 AMD 的 RCAS\n经过修改，加入对比度参数\n和 MAS 支持" },
{ "Depth Aware (RCAS)", "深度感知（RCAS）" },
{ "Use Depth Aware Sharpening (RCAS)\nSmarter sharpening with less artifacts,\nbut also heavier\n\nThe farther away is the object, the more\nsharpening is applied", "使用深度感知锐化（RCAS）\n锐化更智能、伪影更少，\n但性能开销也更高\n\n物体距离越远，应用的\n锐化越强" },
{ "Depth Aware (DAS)", "深度感知（DAS）" },
{ "Use Depth Aware Sharpening (DAS)\nDepth-aware directional adaptive luma sharpener\nSmarter sharpening with less artifacts,\nbut also heavier\n\nThe farther away is the object, the more\nsharpening is applied", "使用深度感知锐化（DAS）\n基于深度的方向自适应亮度锐化器\n锐化更智能、伪影更少，\n但性能开销也更高\n\n物体距离越远，应用的\n锐化越强" },
{ "Enable Motion Adaptive Sharpness", "启用运动自适应锐化" },
{ "Enables sharpness adjustments according to the motion", "根据运动幅度动态调整锐度" },
{ "DA + MAS Debug", "DA + MAS 调试视图" },
{ "Enable DA + MAS debug views\nBlue tint for DA detected edges\n\nMore red areas will have more sharpness applied\nGreen areas will get reduced sharpness", "启用 DA + MAS 调试视图\nDA 检测到的边缘会呈蓝色\n\n越红的区域应用越强的锐化\n绿色区域会降低锐化" },
{ "Advanced DA Parameters", "高级 DA 参数" },
{ "Clamp Output", "钳制输出" },
{ "Clamps the final image to the [0, 1] range.\n\nPrevents overshoot artifacts such as bright halos or negative colors.\nRecommended for LDR pipelines; optional for HDR depending on tone-mapping.\n\nWhen not set OptiScaler controls it via upscalers HDR flag", "将最终图像钳制在 [0, 1] 范围内。\n\n防止亮边光晕或负色彩等过冲伪影。\n建议用于 LDR 管线；HDR 是否启用取决于色调映射。\n\n未设置时，OptiScaler 会根据超分器的 HDR 标志进行控制" },
{ "Depth Bias", "深度偏差" },
{ "Ignores small depth differences before edge detection.\n\nHigher values reduce flickering and noise from minor depth changes, but may soften real geometry edges.\nLower values preserve fine detail but can cause unstable or noisy edge detection.", "在边缘检测前忽略较小的深度差异。\n\n较高的值可减少微小深度变化造成的闪烁和噪点，但可能弱化真实几何边缘。\n较低的值可保留精细细节，但可能导致边缘检测不稳定或噪点增多。" },
{ "Depth Scale", "深度缩放" },
{ "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).", "控制跨越深度边缘时锐化被削弱的程度。\n\n较高的值会更积极地阻止锐化跨越物体边界（减少光晕）。\n较低的值允许更多锐化跨越边缘（更锐利，但风险更高）。" },
{ "Reset Depth Values", "重置深度参数" },
{ "Contrast Enabled", "启用对比度调节" },
{ "Controls sharpness at high contrast areas.", "控制高对比度区域的锐度。" },
{ "Contrast", "对比度" },
{ "Positive values decrease sharpness at high contrast areas.\nNegative values increase sharpness at high contrast areas.", "正值会降低高对比度区域的锐度。\n负值会提高高对比度区域的锐度。" },
{ "Motion Adaptive Sharpness##2", "运动自适应锐化##2" },
{ "MAS Debug", "MAS 调试视图" },
{ "Areas that are more red will have more sharpness applied\nGreen areas will get reduced sharpness", "越红的区域应用越强的锐化\n绿色区域会降低锐化" },
{ "MotionSharpness", "运动锐度" },
{ "Maximum amount of sharpness that motion can add or remove.\n\nNegative values reduce sharpening in motion (recommended).\nPositive values increase sharpening in motion.\n\nThe final adjustment scales with motion and is capped at this value.", "运动最多可增加或减少的锐度。\n\n负值会在运动时降低锐化（推荐）。\n正值会在运动时提高锐化。\n\n最终调整量会随运动幅度变化，并以此值为上限。" },
{ "MotionThreshod", "运动阈值" },
{ "Minimum motion required before motion-based sharpening adjustment begins.\n\nHigher values ignore small movements (more stable).\nLower values react to subtle motion (more sensitive).", "开始进行运动锐化调整所需的最小运动量。\n\n较高的值会忽略轻微运动（更稳定）。\n较低的值会响应细微运动（更灵敏）。" },
{ "MotionRange", "运动范围" },
{ "Defines the motion range over which the effect ramps from zero to full strength.\n\nValues above the threshold are mapped into this range.\nLarger values make the response smoother and more gradual.\nSmaller values make the effect react more quickly and aggressively.", "定义效果从零逐渐提升到完全强度所对应的运动范围。\n\n高于阈值的数值会映射到此范围。\n较大的值会使响应更平滑、更渐进。\n较小的值会使效果响应更快、更强烈。" },
{ "Upscale Ratio Override", "超分比例覆盖" },
{ "Override all", "全部覆盖" },
{ "Overrides every upscaler preset with the set value\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means an internal res of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "使用设定值覆盖所有超分质量预设\n\n在 1080p 屏幕上使用 1.5x，内部渲染分辨率为 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720" },
{ "Override per quality preset", "按质量预设分别覆盖" },
{ "Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "允许分别覆盖每个质量预设的比例\n请注意，并非所有游戏都支持全部质量预设\n\n在 1080p 屏幕上使用 1.5x，内部渲染分辨率为 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720" },
{ "All Ratios", "所有比例" },
{ "Ultra Quality", "超高质量" },
{ "Quality", "质量" },
{ "Balanced", "均衡" },
{ "Performance", "性能" },
{ "Ultra Performance", "超级性能" },
{ "Output Scaling", "输出缩放" },
{ "Enable", "启用" },
{ "Disable", "禁用" },
{ "Upscales the image internally to a higher output resolution\nthen downscales it back to your display resolution\n\nValues <1.0 make the upscaler cheaper\nValues >1.0 make image sharper at the cost of performance\n\nIf greyed out, please check Git Wiki - Unreal Engine tweaks\n\nTarget res and total ratio at the bottom (max. total 3.0!)", "先在内部将图像放大到更高的输出分辨率\n再缩小回显示器分辨率\n\n小于 1.0 的值会降低超分器开销\n大于 1.0 的值会让图像更锐利，但会损失性能\n\n如果该选项为灰色，请查看 Git Wiki - Unreal Engine 调整\n\n底部会显示目标分辨率和总比例（总比例最高 3.0！）" },
{ "Default option.\nGood enough image quality and very fast.", "默认选项。\n图像质量足够好，速度非常快。" },
{ "Fastest traditional option.\nProduces a very soft/blurry image, but might be okay for downscaling.", "最快的传统选项。\n图像会非常柔和或模糊，但用于缩小时可能足够。" },
{ "Designed primarily for downscaling.\nRetains good contrast with minimal artefacts, but softer than Lanczos.", "主要为缩小图像而设计。\n可保持良好对比度且伪影很少，但比 Lanczos 更柔和。" },
{ "Lighter and faster than Lanczos3.\nLess prone to ringing artefacts, but slightly blurrier.", "比 Lanczos3 更轻量、更快。\n较少出现振铃伪影，但会稍微模糊。" },
{ "Heavier version of Lanczos2.\nOffers the sharpest image, but is the most prone to ringing.", "Lanczos2 的高开销版本。\n图像最锐利，但也最容易出现振铃。" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos2.\nSmoother and less prone to artefacts than Lanczos, but slightly blurrier.", "与 Lanczos2 类似。\n比 Lanczos 更平滑且更少产生伪影，但会稍微模糊。" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos3.\nFar less prone to artefacting than Lanczos3, but much heavier on the GPU.", "与 Lanczos3 类似。\n比 Lanczos3 更不容易产生伪影，但 GPU 开销高得多。" },
{ "Specialised to prevent artifacts.\nEliminates harsh halos for a natural look, but can appear slightly soft.", "专门用于抑制伪影。\n可消除明显光晕并获得自然观感，但可能略显柔和。" },
{ "Only FSR1 and Bicubic are supported when Ratio is below 1.0.", "比例低于 1.0 时仅支持 FSR1 和 Bicubic。" },
