{ "Sync Int.", "同步间隔" },
{ "Controls the DXGI Present sync interval, which determines how\nthe swap chain waits for vertical refresh.\n\n0  = Present immediately, no VSync wait.\n1  = Sync to every refresh, normal VSync.\n2+ = Present every N refreshes, reducing effective frame rate.\n\nHigher values can reduce tearing but may increase latency and cap FPS.\nFor most games, use 0 for lowest latency or 1 for normal VSync.", "控制 DXGI Present 同步间隔，决定交换链如何\n等待垂直刷新。\n\n0  = 立即呈现，不等待 VSync。\n1  = 每次刷新同步，即普通 VSync。\n2+ = 每 N 次刷新呈现一次，降低有效帧率。\n\n较高的值可减少画面撕裂，但可能增加延迟并限制 FPS。\n大多数游戏建议使用 0 获得最低延迟，或使用 1 启用普通 VSync。" },
